pdate log, 2023. Available at: https://developers.weixin.qq.com/miniprogram/dev/devtools/stable.html.","url":"https://spectrum.library.concordia.ca/id/eprint/993109/1/Baskaran_MASc_S2024.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"s3.cn-north-1.amazonaws.com.cn","ref_id":"turn1search15","snippet":"根据《工业和信息化部关于开展移动互联网应用程序备案工作的通知》以及工信部的官方解读，在通知发布（2023 年 8 月 8 日）后拟开展业务的 APP，应先履行备案手续后再开展业务。 ... 省级通信管理局在收到 APP 主办者提交的备案材料后，材料齐全并准确的，在二十个工作日内予以备案，发放备案编号，并通过短信、邮件形式告知，主办者也可以通过备案系统网站 http://beian.miit.gov","title":"5. 小程序、快应用向谁进行备案申请？","url":"https://s3.cn-north-1.amazonaws.com.cn/aws-dam-prod/whitepapers/app-nwcd-new.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"kee1ongz.github.io","ref_id":"turn1search16","snippet":"Hedin et al. [52] proposed a security-enhanced JavaScript interpreter, JSFlow, for fine-grained information flow tracking. ... *The Page Object in WeChat Mini-programs.* https://developers.weixin.qq.c","title":"MiniCAT: Understanding and Detecting Cross-Page Request Forgery Vulnerabilities in Mini-Programs","url":"https://kee1ongz.github.io/paper/ccs24-zhang.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"chaowang.dev","ref_id":"turn1search17","snippet":"[7] “Scope list of wechat,” https://developers.weixin.qq.com/miniprogram/en/dev/framework/open-ability/authorize.html. ... [30] ———, “Wechat official documents - wecom pre-development notes,” https://","title":"[7] “Scope list of wechat,” https://developers.weixin.qq.com/miniprogram/en/dev/framework/open-ability/authorize.html.","url":"https://chaowang.dev/publications/sec23a.pdf"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn1search18","snippet":"In the fields of database s and transaction processing (transaction management), a schedule (or history) of a system is an abstract model to describe the","title":"Database transaction schedule","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Database_transaction_schedule"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"arxiv.org","ref_id":"turn1academia19","snippet":"If this key is leaked in the front-end of the mini-programs, it can lead to catastrophic attacks on both mini-program developers and users. ... We","title":"Don't Leak Your Keys: Understanding, Measuring, and Exploiting the AppSecret Leaks in Mini-Programs","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.08151"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn1search20","snippet":"当事务被提交给了数据库管理系统（DBMS），则DBMS需要确保该事务中的所有操作都成功完成且其结果被永久保存在数据库中，如果事务中有的操作没有成功完成，则事务中的所有操作都需要回滚，回到事务执行前的状态；同时，该事务对数据库或者其他事务的执行无影响，所有的事务都好像在独立的运行。 ... 《数据库系统基础（第四版）》(Fundamentals of Database System (Fourth ","title":"数据库事务","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E4%BA%8B%E5%8A%A1"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn1search21","snippet":"事务处理是被设计用来维持系统的完整性（通常是一个数据库或是一些现代的文件系统）在一个已知的，一致的状态。 ... 如果事务的所有操作被成功完成，事务会被系统提交，所有数据库中的改变变为永久性的；一旦这个操作完成事务不能再被回滚。 ... 因此，事务处理的并发实施被编程保证最终结果反映了一个没有冲突的结局，如果以任何顺序执行事务也能得到同样的结果（一种叫做[可串行性]的属性）。","title":"事务处理","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%8B%E5%8A%A1%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"arxiv.org","ref_id":"turn1academia22","snippet":"Title: A Hybrid Security Framework for Mini-Programs: Visual UI Compliance and Network Risk Assessment ... To address the above issues, this article develops a detection","title":"A Hybrid Security Framework for Mini-Programs: Visual UI Compliance and Network Risk Assessment","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.25877"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"arxiv.org","ref_id":"turn1academia23","snippet":"However, improper integration of OAuth-based Authentication (OBA) flows by third-party developers can lead to critical security flaws.In this paper, we discover three new types of","title":"Mini-Programs, Mega-Problems: Unveiling OAuth-based Authentication Misuses in Mini-Programs via Dynamic Analysis","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.08232"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn1search24","snippet":"2023年9月，苹果公司要求于中国大陆区App Store上架的应用程序必须具备有效的官方备案号才能上架。 ... * https://beian.miit.gov.cn/#/Integrated/index","title":"ICP备案","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICP%E5%A4%87%E6%A1%88"},{"type":"text_result","ref_id":"turn1view0","snippet":"Total lines: 1","title":"Internal Error"}]}}
